  "title": "2026-07-25-eval-160035 · ivr-agent-handoff",
  "description": "Inbound phone-support flow from telephony trunk through pre-greeting customer lookup, consent, and speech/keypad intent capture. Routine requests go to a constrained AI voice agent; unresolved, human-requested, or risky calls transfer with full context to a human queue, with callback offered when the wait target is missed. Recordings, transcripts, unresolved calls, and abandonment feed quality review and adjust the AI intent allowlist. Read left-to-right across the top, then through the AI/human paths and down into review.",
